ral or cultural point of view"@en;  sh:name "Historical or cultural resource"@en, "Recurso histórico o cultural"@es;  sh:nodeKind sh:IRI;  sh:targetClass estur:HistoricalOrCulturalResource;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/HistoricalOrCulturalResourceHasAdditionalHistoricalOrCulturalResourceServiceSKOS> .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/HistoricalOrCulturalResourceHasAdditionalHistoricalOrCulturalResourceServiceSKOS>  a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "Complementary or additional services that a historical or cultural resource may offer alongside its main service or activity in order to enhance or improve the user experience."@en,    "Servicios complementarios o adicionales que puede ofrecer un recurso histórico o cultural junto a su servicio o actividad principal para ampliar o mejorar la experiencia del usuario."@es;  sh:path estur:hasAdditionalHistoricalOrCulturalResourceService;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/HistoricalOrCulturalResourceHasAdditionalHistoricalOrCulturalResourceServiceSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "hasAdditionalHistoricalOrCulturalResourceService: The instance of HistoricalOrCulturalResource has a hasAdditionalHistoricalOrCulturalResourceService value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/HistoricalOrCulturalResourceHasAdditionalHistoricalOrCulturalResourceServiceSKOSInScheme>  a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/AdditionalHistoricalOrCulturalResourceService>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "hasAdditionalHistoricalOrCulturalResourceService: The instance of HistoricalOrCulturalResource has a hasAdditionalHistoricalOrCulturalResourceService value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/AdditionalHistoricalOrC