ilitating mobility both locally and globally."@en;  sh:name "Infraestructura de transporte"@es, "Transport infrastructure"@en;  sh:nodeKind sh:IRI;  sh:targetClass estur:TransportInfrastructure;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/TransportInfrastructureHasAdditionalTransportInfrastructureServiceSKOS> .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/TransportInfrastructureHasAdditionalTransportInfrastructureServiceSKOS>  a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "Complementary or additional services that a transport infrastructure may offer alongside its main service or activity in order to enhance or improve the user experience."@en,    "Servicios complementarios o adicionales que puede ofrecer una infraestructura de transporte junto a su servicio o actividad principal para ampliar o mejorar la experiencia del usuario."@es;  sh:path estur:hasAdditionalTransportInfrastructureService;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/TransportInfrastructureHasAdditionalTransportInfrastructureServiceSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "hasAdditionalTransportInfrastructureService: The instance of TransportInfrastructure has a hasAdditionalTransportInfrastructureService value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/TransportInfrastructureHasAdditionalTransportInfrastructureServiceSKOSInScheme>  a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/AdditionalTransportInfrastructureService>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "hasAdditionalTransportInfrastructureService: The instance of TransportInfrastructure has a hasAdditionalTransportInfrastructureService value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/AdditionalTransportInfrastructureService."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/Transport