ologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/MuseumType>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "museumType: The instance of Museum has a museumType value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/MuseumType."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/SingularTreeShape> a sh:NodeShape;  rdfs:label "Singular tree"@en, "Árbol singular"@es;  sh:description "Tree that stands out among others due to its size, shape, age, rarity, biological origin, state of conservation, beauty or for being part of myths or traditions."@en,    "Árbol que destaca entre los demás por su tamaño, forma, edad, rareza, origen biológico, estado de conservación, belleza o por formar parte de mitos o tradiciones."@es;  sh:name "Singular tree"@en, "Árbol singular"@es;  sh:nodeKind sh:IRI;  sh:targetClass estur:SingularTree;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/SingularTreeSingularTreeTypeSKOS> .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/SingularTreeSingularTreeTypeSKOS> a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "Categorización de árboles singulares en función de sus características."@es,    "Classification of singular trees based on their characteristics."@en;  sh:path estur:singularTreeType;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/SingularTreeSingularTreeTypeSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "singularTreeType: The instance of SingularTree has a singularTreeType value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/SingularTreeSingularTreeTypeSKOSInScheme>  a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/SingularTreeType>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "singularTreeType: The instance of SingularTree has a singularTreeType value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on t