age "socialMediaPlatform: The instance of SocialMediaProfile has a socialMediaPlatform value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/SocialMediaPlatform."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/PetAdmissionPolicySpeciesSKOS> a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "Biological species of pets whose entry is permitted."@en, "Especies biológicas de mascotas cuyo ingreso es permitido."@es;  sh:path estur:species;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/PetAdmissionPolicySpeciesSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "species: The instance of PetAdmissionPolicy has a species value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/PetAdmissionPolicySpeciesSKOSInScheme>  a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/Species>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "species: The instance of PetAdmissionPolicy has a species value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/Species."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/SportsCentreShape> a sh:NodeShape;  rdfs:label "Polideportivo"@es, "Sports centre"@en;  sh:description "Lugar que dispone de diferentes instalaciones e infraestructuras para la práctica de disciplinas deportivas."@es,    "Place that has different facilities and infrastructure for practicing sports disciplines."@en;  sh:name "Polideportivo"@es, "Sports centre"@en;  sh:nodeKind sh:IRI;  sh:targetClass estur:SportsCentre;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/SportsCentreSportsCentrePremisesSKOS> .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/SportsCentreSportsCentrePremisesSKOS>  a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "Espacios, equipamientos y estructuras físicas que están d