os/AdditionalPetAccommodationService."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/HistoricalOrCulturalResourceShape> sh:property    <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/HistoricalOrCulturalResourceHasAdditionalPetTourismResourceServiceSKOS>,    <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/HistoricalOrCulturalResourceHasAdditionalTourismResourceServiceSKOS>,    <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/HistoricalOrCulturalResourcePaymentMethodSKOS>,    <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/HistoricalOrCulturalResourceHasTagSKOS>,    <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/HistoricalOrCulturalResourceTouristTypeSKOS>,    <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/HistoricalOrCulturalResourceTravelUnitSKOS> .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/HistoricalOrCulturalResourceHasAdditionalPetTourismResourceServiceSKOS>  a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "Complementary or additional services that a tourism resource may offer alongside its main service or activity in order to enhance or improve the experience of a tourist with pets."@en,    "Servicios complementarios o adicionales que puede ofrecer un recurso turístico junto a su servicio o actividad principal para ampliar o mejorar la experiencia del turista con mascotas."@es;  sh:path estur:hasAdditionalPetTourismResourceService;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/HistoricalOrCulturalResourceHasAdditionalPetTourismResourceServiceSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "hasAdditionalPetTourismResourceService: The instance of HistoricalOrCulturalResource has a hasAdditionalPetTourismResourceService value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/HistoricalOrCulturalResourceHasAdditionalPetTourismResourceServiceSKOSInScheme>  a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/AdditionalPetTourismResourceService>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "hasAdditionalPetTourismResourceService: The instance of HistoricalOrCulturalResource has a hasAdditionalPetTourismResourceService value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/AdditionalPetTourismResourceService."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/AccommodationEstablishmentHasAdditionalTourismOrRelatedFacilityServiceSKOS>  a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "Complementary or additional services that a tourism or related facility may offer alongside its main service or activity in order to enhance or improve the user experience."@en,    "Servicios complementarios o adicionales que puede ofrecer una instalación turística o vinculada junto a su servicio o actividad principal para ampliar o mejorar la experiencia del usuario."@es;  sh:path estur:hasAdditionalTourismOrRelatedFacilityService;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/AccommodationEstablishmentHasAdditionalTourismOrRelatedFacilityServiceSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "hasAdditionalTourismOrRelatedFacilityService: The instance of AccommodationEstablishment has a hasAdditionalTourismOrRelatedFacilityService value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/AccommodationEstablishmentHasAdditionalTourismOrRelatedFacilityServiceSKOSInScheme>  a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/AdditionalTourismOrRelatedFacilityService>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "hasAdditionalTourismOrRelatedFacilityService: The instance of AccommodationEstablishment has a hasAdditionalTourismOrRelatedFacilityService value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/AdditionalTourismOrRelatedFacilityService."@en .