Extensiones de terreno en las que se localizan un número indeterminado de viñas que -por razón de su situación y condiciones micro-climáticas, por su composición geológica o por su orografía- comparten condiciones similares y producen por ello uvas con características diferenciadas que dan lugar a unos vinos muy singulares, generalmente conocidos como vinos de pago"@es;  sh:name "Pago"@es, "Terroir"@en;  sh:nodeKind sh:IRI;  sh:targetClass estur:Terroir;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/TerroirHasAdditionalWineTourismFacilityServiceSKOS> .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/TerroirHasAdditionalWineTourismFacilityServiceSKOS>  a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "Complementary or additional services that a wine tourism facility may offer alongside its main service or activity in order to enhance or improve the user experience."@en,    "Servicios complementarios o adicionales que puede ofrecer una instalación de enoturismo junto a su servicio o actividad principal para ampliar o mejorar la experiencia del usuario."@es;  sh:path estur:hasAdditionalWineTourismFacilityService;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/TerroirHasAdditionalWineTourismFacilityServiceSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "hasAdditionalWineTourismFacilityService: The instance of Terroir has a hasAdditionalWineTourismFacilityService value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/TerroirHasAdditionalWineTourismFacilityServiceSKOSInScheme>  a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/AdditionalWineTourismFacilityService>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "hasAdditionalWineTourismFacilityService: The instance of Terroir has a hasAdditionalWineTourismFacilityService value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/AdditionalWineTourismFacilityService."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/AccommodationEstablishmentHasPriceClassSKOS>  a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "A range of prices at which products or services are offered, allowing them to be classified into different segments within a given market or industry."@en,    "Rango de precios en el que se ofrecen productos o servicios que permiten clasificarlos en diferentes segmentos dentro de un determinado mercado o industria."@es;  sh:path estur:hasPriceClass;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/AccommodationEstablishmentHasPriceClassSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "hasPriceClass: The instance of AccommodationEstablishment has a hasPriceClass value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/AccommodationEstablishmentHasPriceClassSKOSInScheme>  a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/PriceClass>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "hasPriceClass: The instance of AccommodationEstablishment has a hasPriceClass value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/PriceClass."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/EventHasTagSKOS> a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "Conjunto de etiquetas utilizadas para clasificar y describir de forma sintética características, temáticas, atributos o enfoques experienciales asociados a un elemento."@es,    "Set of tags used to classify and describe, in a transversal manner, characteristics, themes, attributes or experiential approaches associated with an item."@en;  sh:path estur:hasTag;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/EventHasTagSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "hasTag: The instance of Event has a hasTag value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/EventHasTagSKOSInScheme> a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/Tag>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "hasTag: The instance of Event has a hasTag value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/Tag."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/RouteShape> sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/RouteLocomotionModeSKOS>,    <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/RouteHasAdditionalPetTourismResourceServiceSKOS>,    <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/RouteHasAdditionalTourismResourceServiceSKOS>,    <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/RoutePaymentMethodSKOS>, <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/RouteHasTagSKOS>,    <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/RouteTouristTypeSKOS>, <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/RouteTravelUnitSKOS> .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/RouteLocomotionModeSKOS> a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "Forma específica en que se realiza el desplazamiento durante una ruta o actividad organizada, definida por el medio o método de transporte utilizado."@es,    "Specific way in which movement is carried out during a route or organized activity, defined by the means or method of transportation used."@en;  sh:path estur:locomotionMode;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/RouteLocomotionModeSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "locomotionMode: The instance of Route has a locomotionMode value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/RouteLocomotionModeSKOSInScheme> a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/LocomotionMode>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "locomotionMode: The instance of Route has a locomotionMode value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/LocomotionMode."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/FoodAndBeverageServiceShape> a sh:NodeShape;  rdfs:label "Food and beverage service"@en, "Servicio de comidas y bebidas"@es;  sh:description " A tourism service that encompasses the preparation, provision, and consumption of food and beverages offered to customers by food and beverage establishments, either for on-site consumption or takeaway."@en,    "Servicio turístico que comprende la preparación, elaboración, suministro y consumo de alimentos y bebidas ofrecidos a los clientes por establecimientos de restauración, ya sea para su consumo en el propio establecimiento o para llevar."@es;  sh:name "Food and beverage service"@en, "Servicio de comidas y bebidas"@es;  sh:nodeKind sh:IRI;  sh:targetClass estur:FoodAndBeverageService;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/FoodAndBeverageServiceMenuOptionsSKOS>,    <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/FoodAndBeverageServiceServesCuisineSKOS> .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/FoodAndBeverageServiceMenuOptionsSKOS>  a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "Alternativas o elecciones que están disponibles en un establecimiento de restauración en relación a los tipos de alimentos que se ofrecen. Estas opciones pueden adaptarse a las preferencias y necesidades dietéticas de los comensales, incluyendo alergias alimentarias, restricciones dietéticas, preferencias vegetarianas o veganas, entre otros."@es,    "Options or choices available in a food establishment regarding the types of food offered. These options may be adapted to diners’ preferences and dietary needs, including food allergies, dietary restrictions, vegetarian or vegan preferences, among others."@en;  sh:path estur:menuOptions;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/FoodAndBeverageServiceMenuOptionsSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "menuOptions: The instance of FoodAndBeverageService has a menuOptions value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/FoodAndBeverageServiceMenuOptionsSKOSInScheme>  a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/MenuOptions>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "menuOptions: The instance of FoodAndBeverageService has a menuOptions value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/MenuOptions."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/HistoricalOrCulturalResourcePaymentMethodSKOS>  a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "Method used by the customer to pay for the service."@en, "Método utilizado por el cliente para pagar el servicio."@es;  sh:path estur:paymentMethod;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/HistoricalOrCulturalResourcePaymentMethodSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "paymentMethod: The instance of HistoricalOrCulturalResource has a paymentMethod value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/HistoricalOrCulturalResourcePaymentMethodSKOSInScheme>  a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/PaymentMethod>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "paymentMethod: The instance of HistoricalOrCulturalResource has a paymentMethod value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/PaymentMethod."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/FoodAndBeverageServiceServesCuisineSKOS>  a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "Culinary tradition, preparation style, or regional cuisine of the world offered by a food establishment."@en,    "Tradición culinaria, estilo de preparación o cocina regional del mundo que ofrece un establecimiento de restauración."@es;  sh:path estur:servesCuisine;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/FoodAndBeverageServiceServesCuisineSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "servesCuisine: The instance of FoodAndBeverageService has a servesCuisine value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/FoodAndBeverageServiceServesCuisineSKOSInScheme>  a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/CuisineType>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "servesCuisine: The instance of FoodAndBeverageService has a servesCuisine value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/CuisineType."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/PriceSpecificationShape> a sh:NodeShape;  rdfs:label "Especificación del precio"@es, "Price specification"@en;  sh:description "Coste total del producto o servicio que puede incluir impuestos, cargos o reducciones en las tarifas."@es,    "Total cost of the product or service that may include taxes, charges, or rate reductions."@en;  sh:name "Especificación del precio"@es, "Price specification"@en;  sh:nodeKind sh:IRI;  sh:targetClass estur:PriceSpecification;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/PriceSpecificationTargetAudienceSKOS> .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/PriceSpecificationTargetAudienceSKOS>  a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "A specific group of people targeted by a price or special offer, based on their age."@en,    "Grupo específico de personas al que va dirigido un precio o una propuesta especial, según la edad."@es;  sh:path estur:targetAudience;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/PriceSpecificationTargetAudienceSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "targetAudience: The instance of PriceSpecification has a targetAudience value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/PriceSpecificationTargetAudienceSKOSInScheme>  a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/TargetAudience>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "targetAudience: The instance of PriceSpecification has a targetAudience value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/TargetAudience."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/AgrotourismExperienceShape> sh:property    <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/AgrotourismExperienceTimeOfTheYearSKOS>,    <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/AgrotourismExperienceHasPriceClassSKOS> .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/AgrotourismExperienceTimeOfTheYearSKOS>  a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "A seasonal period during which a destination experience, agrotourism experience, or route is recommended, or during which it has greater relevance, intensity, or appeal."@en,    "Periodo estacional en el que se recomienda realizar la experiencia en destino, experiencia agroturística o ruta, o en el que esta tiene mayor relevancia, intensidad o atractivo."@es;  sh:path estur:timeOfTheYear;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/AgrotourismExperienceTimeOfTheYearSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "timeOfTheYear: The instance of AgrotourismExperience has a timeOfTheYear value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/AgrotourismExperienceTimeOfTheYearSKOSInScheme>  a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/TimeOfTheYear>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "timeOfTheYear: The instance of AgrotourismExperience has a timeOfTheYear value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/TimeOfTheYear."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/TourShape> sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/TourTourSpecialtySKOS>,    <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/TourTimeOfTheYearSKOS>, <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/TourHasPriceClassSKOS> .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/TourTourSpecialtySKOS> a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "Enfoque particular o características únicas que distinguen al servicio de visita guiada."@es,    "Particular focus or unique features that distinguish the tour service."@en;  sh:path estur:tourSpecialty;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/TourTourSpecialtySKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "tourSpecialty: The instance of Tour has a tourSpecialty value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/TourTourSpecialtySKOSInScheme> a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/TourSpecialty>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "tourSpecialty: The instance of Tour has a tourSpecialty value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/TourSpecialty."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/EventTouristTypeSKOS> a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "Clasificación para eventos, propuestas especiales, destinos y organizaciones turísticas, instalaciones turísticas o vinculadas, recursos y servicios turísticos en función de sus turistas objetivo con relación a sus motivaciones principales de viaje."@es,    """Classification for events, special offers, destinations andtourism organisations, tourism or related facilities, tourism resources and services based on their target tourists in relation to their main travel motivations."""@en;  sh:path estur:touristType;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/EventTouristTypeSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "touristType: The instance of Event has a touristType value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/EventTouristTypeSKOSInScheme> a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/TouristType>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "touristType: The instance of Event has a touristType value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/TouristType."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/EventTravelUnitSKOS> a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "Clasificación de eventos, propuestas especiales, destinos y organizaciones turísticas, instalaciones turísticas o relacionadas, recursos y servicios turísticos en función de sus turistas objetivo con relación a la composición del grupo con el que viajan y comparten los gastos asociados."@es,    "Classification for events, special offers, tourism destinations and organisations, tourism or related facilities, tourism resources and services based on their target tourists in relation to the composition of the party with whom they travel and share the associated expenses."@en;  sh:path estur:travelUnit;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/EventTravelUnitSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "travelUnit: The instance of Event has a travelUnit value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/EventTravelUnitSKOSInScheme> a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/TravelUnit>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "travelUnit: The instance of Event has a travelUnit value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/TravelUnit."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/LodgingServiceShape> a sh:NodeShape;  rdfs:label "Lodging service"@en, "Servicio de hospedaje"@es;  sh:description "A proposal of a tourism organisation to sell a specific set of products (accommodation) or services under specific conditions or rates, for a certain price."@en,    "Una propuesta de una organización turística para vender un conjunto específico de productos (hospedaje) o servicios en condiciones o tarifas específicas, por un precio determinado."@es;  sh:name "Lodging service"@en, "Servicio de hospedaje"@es;  sh:nodeKind sh:IRI;  sh:targetClass estur:LodgingService;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/LodgingServiceAccommodationRateTypeSKOS>,    <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/LodgingServiceAccommodationUnitCategorySKOS>,    <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/LodgingServiceHasAdditionalAccommodationServiceSKOS>,    <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/LodgingServiceHasAdditionalPetAccommodationServiceSKOS> .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/LodgingServiceAccommodationRateTypeSKOS>  a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "Rates applicable specifically to accommodation establishments and lodging services."@en,    "Tarifas aplicables específicamente a establecimientos alojativos y servicios de hospedaje."@es;  sh:path estur:accommodationRateType;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/LodgingServiceAccommodationRateTypeSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "accommodationRateType: The instance of LodgingService has a accommodationRateType value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/LodgingServiceAccommodationRateTypeSKOSInScheme>  a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/AccommodationRateType>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "accommodationRateType: The instance of LodgingService has a accommodationRateType value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/AccommodationRateType."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/LodgingServiceAccommodationUnitCategorySKOS>  a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "Tipo de unidad de alojamiento que se ofrece a los huéspedes y en la que se les proporcionan, como mínimo, camas y servicios de higiene."@es,    "Type of accommodation unit offered to guests, in which they are provided with, at least, sleeping and sanitary facilities."@en;  sh:path estur:accommodationUnitCategory;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/LodgingServiceAccommodationUnitCategorySKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "accommodationUnitCategory: The instance of LodgingService has a accommodationUnitCategory value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/LodgingServiceAccommodationUnitCategorySKOSInScheme>  a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/AccommodationUnitCategory>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "accommodationUnitCategory: The instance of LodgingService has a accommodationUnitCategory value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/AccommodationUnitCategory."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/AdventureActivityCentreShape> a sh:NodeShape;  rdfs:label "Adventure activity centre"@en, "Centro de actividades de aventura"@es;  sh:description "Center oriented towards sports or practices that involve, in addition to physical activity, intense recreational activity in the natural environment."@en,    "Centro orientado a los deportes o prácticas que conllevan, además de una actividad física, una intensa actividad recreativa en el medio natural."@es;  sh:name "Adventure activity centre"@en, "Centro de actividades de aventura"@es;  sh:nodeKind sh:IRI;  sh:targetClass estur:AdventureActivityCentre;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/AdventureActivityCentreAdventureActivityTypeSKOS> .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/AdventureActivityCentreAdventureActivityTypeSKOS>  a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "Actividades físicas, deportivas o recreativas ofrecidas por el centro."@es,    "Physical, sports, or recreational activities offered by the facility."@en;  sh:path estur:adventureActivityType;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/AdventureActivityCentreAdventureActivityTypeSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "adventureActivityType: The instance of AdventureActivityCentre has a adventureActivityType value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/AdventureActivityCentreAdventureActivityTypeSKOSInScheme>  a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/AdventureActivityType>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "adventureActivityType: The instance of AdventureActivityCentre has a adventureActivityType value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/AdventureActivityType."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/TourismServiceShape> a sh:NodeShape;  rdfs:label "Servicio turístico"@es, "Tourism Service"@en;  sh:description "Prestación destinada a satisfacer las necesidades del turista en el destino."@es,    "Service designed to meet the needs of tourists at the destination."@en;  sh:name "Servicio turístico"@es, "Tourism Service"@en;  sh:nodeKind sh:IRI;  sh:targetClass estur:TourismService;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/TourismServiceAvailableLanguageSKOS> .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/TourismServiceAvailableLanguageSKOS>  a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "Idioma o conjunto de idiomas en los que un artículo, contenido o recurso puede ser utilizado, presentado o comunicado, ya sea de forma hablada, escrita o mediante otros medios de expresión."@es,    "Language or set of languages in which an article, content, or resource can be used, presented, or communicated, whether in spoken, written, or other forms of expression."@en;  sh:path estur:availableLanguage;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/TourismServiceAvailableLanguageSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "availableLanguage: The instance of TourismService has a availableLanguage value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/TourismServiceAvailableLanguageSKOSInScheme>  a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/iso639-2>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "availableLanguage: The instance of TourismService has a availableLanguage value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/iso639-2."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/LodgingServiceHasAdditionalAccommodationServiceSKOS>  a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "Complementary or additional services that an accommodation establishment may offer alongside its main service or activity in order to enhance or improve the user experience."@en,    "Servicios complementarios o adicionales que puede ofrecer un establecimiento alojativo junto a su servicio o actividad principal para ampliar o mejorar la experiencia del usuario."@es;  sh:path estur:hasAdditionalAccommodationService;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/LodgingServiceHasAdditionalAccommodationServiceSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "hasAdditionalAccommodationService: The instance of LodgingService has a hasAdditionalAccommodationService value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/LodgingServiceHasAdditionalAccommodationServiceSKOSInScheme>  a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/AdditionalAccommodationService>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "hasAdditionalAccommodationService: The instance of LodgingService has a hasAdditionalAccommodationService value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/AdditionalAccommodationService."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/LodgingServiceHasAdditionalPetAccommodationServiceSKOS>  a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "Complementary or additional services that an accommodation establishment may offer alongside its main service or activity in order to enhance or improve the experience of a tourist with pets."@en,    "Servicios complementarios o adicionales que puede ofrecer un establecimiento alojativo junto a su servicio o actividad principal para ampliar o mejorar la experiencia del turista con mascotas."@es;  sh:path estur:hasAdditionalPetAccommodationService;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/LodgingServiceHasAdditionalPetAccommodationServiceSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "hasAdditionalPetAccommodationService: The instance of LodgingService has a hasAdditionalPetAccommodationService value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/LodgingServiceHasAdditionalPetAccommodationServiceSKOSInScheme>  a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/AdditionalPetAccommodationService>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "hasAdditionalPetAccommodationService: The instance of LodgingService has a hasAdditionalPetAccommodationService value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/AdditionalPetAccommodationService."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/NaturalResourceShape> a sh:NodeShape;  rdfs:label "Natural resource"@en, "Recurso natural"@es;  sh:description "Lugar, paisaje o fenómeno de la naturaleza que posee un valor especial y atractivo para los turistas. Son apreciados por su belleza escénica, biodiversidad, características geológicas únicas o experiencias al aire libre que ofrecen a los visitantes."@es,    "Place, landscape or natural phenomenon that has a special and attractive value for tourists. They are appreciated for their scenic beauty, biodiversity, unique geological features or outdoor experiences they offer to visitors."@en;  sh:name "Natural resource"@en, "Recurso natural"@es;  sh:nodeKind sh:IRI;  sh:targetClass estur:NaturalResource;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/NaturalResourceHasAdditionalPetTourismResourceServiceSKOS>,    <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/NaturalResourceHasAdditionalTourismResourceServiceSKOS>,    <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/NaturalResourcePaymentMethodSKOS>, <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/NaturalResourceHasTagSKOS>,    <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/NaturalResourceTouristTypeSKOS>, <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/NaturalResourceTravelUnitSKOS> .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/NaturalResourceHasAdditionalPetTourismResourceServiceSKOS>  a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "Complementary or additional services that a tourism resource may offer alongside its main service or activity in order to enhance or improve the experience of a tourist with pets."@en,    "Servicios complementarios o adicionales que puede ofrecer un recurso turístico junto a su servicio o actividad principal para ampliar o mejorar la experiencia del turista con mascotas."@es;  sh:path estur:hasAdditionalPetTourismResourceService;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/NaturalResourceHasAdditionalPetTourismResourceServiceSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "hasAdditionalPetTourismResourceService: The instance of NaturalResource has a hasAdditionalPetTourismResourceService value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/NaturalResourceHasAdditionalPetTourismResourceServiceSKOSInScheme>  a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/AdditionalPetTourismResourceService>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "hasAdditionalPetTourismResourceService: The instance of NaturalResource has a hasAdditionalPetTourismResourceService value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/AdditionalPetTourismResourceService."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/AgrotourismFacilityShape> a sh:NodeShape;  rdfs:label "Agrotourism facility"@en, "Instalación agroturística"@es;  sh:description "Explotaciones del sector primario que prestan servicios turísticos resultantes en experiencias agroturísticas capaces de atraer visitantes y compatibles con la producción principal de la explotación."@es,    "Primary sector exploitation providing tourist services resulting in agrotourism experiences capable of attracting visitors and compatible with the main production of the exploitation."@en;  sh:name "Agrotourism facility"@en, "Instalación agroturística"@es;  sh:nodeKind sh:IRI;  sh:targetClass estur:AgrotourismFacility;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/AgrotourismFacilityHasAdditionalTourismOrRelatedFacilityServiceSKOS> .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/AgrotourismFacilityHasAdditionalTourismOrRelatedFacilityServiceSKOS>  a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "Complementary or additional services that a tourism or related facility may offer alongside its main service or activity in order to enhance or improve the user experience."@en,    "Servicios complementarios o adicionales que puede ofrecer una instalación turística o vinculada junto a su servicio o actividad principal para ampliar o mejorar la experiencia del usuario."@es;  sh:path estur:hasAdditionalTourismOrRelatedFacilityService;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/AgrotourismFacilityHasAdditionalTourismOrRelatedFacilityServiceSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "hasAdditionalTourismOrRelatedFacilityService: The instance of AgrotourismFacility has a hasAdditionalTourismOrRelatedFacilityService value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/AgrotourismFacilityHasAdditionalTourismOrRelatedFacilityServiceSKOSInScheme>  a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/AdditionalTourismOrRelatedFacilityService>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "hasAdditionalTourismOrRelatedFacilityService: The instance of AgrotourismFacility has a hasAdditionalTourismOrRelatedFacilityService value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/AdditionalTourismOrRelatedFacilityService."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/NaturalResourceHasAdditionalTourismResourceServiceSKOS>  a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "Complementary or additional services that a tourism resource may offer alongside its main service or activity in order to enhance or improve the user experience."@en,    "Servicios complementarios o adicionales que puede ofrecer un recurso turístico junto a su servicio o actividad principal para ampliar o mejorar la experiencia del usuario."@es;  sh:path estur:hasAdditionalTourismResourceService;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/NaturalResourceHasAdditionalTourismResourceServiceSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "hasAdditionalTourismResourceService: The instance of NaturalResource has a hasAdditionalTourismResourceService value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/NaturalResourceHasAdditionalTourismResourceServiceSKOSInScheme>  a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/AdditionalTourismResourceService>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "hasAdditionalTourismResourceService: The instance of NaturalResource has a hasAdditionalTourismResourceService value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/AdditionalTourismResourceService."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/UndergroundWineCellarShape> a sh:NodeShape;  rdfs:label "Calado"@es, "Underground wine cellar"@en;  sh:description "A cellar, cave or underground winery with high humidity and a constant temperature throughout the year, used for maturing and ageing wines"@en,    "Cava, cueva o bodega subterránea con mucha humedad ambiente y temperatura constante todo el año que se utiliza para criar y envejecer vinos"@es;  sh:name "Calado"@es, "Underground wine cellar"@en;  sh:nodeKind sh:IRI;  sh:targetClass estur:UndergroundWineCellar;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/UndergroundWineCellarHasAdditionalWineTourismFacilityServiceSKOS> .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/UndergroundWineCellarHasAdditionalWineTourismFacilityServiceSKOS>  a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "Complementary or additional services that a wine tourism facility may offer alongside its main service or activity in order to enhance or improve the user experience."@en,    "Servicios complementarios o adicionales que puede ofrecer una instalación de enoturismo junto a su servicio o actividad principal para ampliar o mejorar la experiencia del usuario."@es;  sh:path estur:hasAdditionalWineTourismFacilityService;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/UndergroundWineCellarHasAdditionalWineTourismFacilityServiceSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "hasAdditionalWineTourismFacilityService: The instance of UndergroundWineCellar has a hasAdditionalWineTourismFacilityService value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/UndergroundWineCellarHasAdditionalWineTourismFacilityServiceSKOSInScheme>  a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/AdditionalWineTourismFacilityService>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "hasAdditionalWineTourismFacilityService: The instance of UndergroundWineCellar has a hasAdditionalWineTourismFacilityService value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/AdditionalWineTourismFacilityService."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/AdventureActivityHasPriceClassSKOS> a    sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "A range of prices at which products or services are offered, allowing them to be classified into different segments within a given market or industry."@en,   