toricalOrCulturalResource has a hasTag value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/Tag."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/TrailShape> a sh:NodeShape;  rdfs:label "Sendero"@es, "Trail"@en;  sh:description "Road, path or path that is characterized by being very small and narrow and that is generally found in rural areas"@en,    "Vía, senda o camino que se caracteriza por ser muy pequeña y angosta y que por lo general se encuentran en las zonas rurales."@es;  sh:name "Sendero"@es, "Trail"@en;  sh:nodeKind sh:IRI;  sh:targetClass estur:Trail;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/TrailLocomotionModeSKOS> .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/TrailLocomotionModeSKOS> a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "Forma específica en que se realiza el desplazamiento durante una ruta o actividad organizada, definida por el medio o método de transporte utilizado."@es,    "Specific way in which movement is carried out during a route or organized activity, defined by the means or method of transportation used."@en;  sh:path estur:locomotionMode;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/TrailLocomotionModeSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "locomotionMode: The instance of Trail has a locomotionMode value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/TrailLocomotionModeSKOSInScheme> a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/LocomotionMode>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "locomotionMode: The instance of Trail has a locomotionMode value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/LocomotionMode."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/FoodEstablishmentShape> sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/FoodEstablishmentMenuOptionsSKOS>,    <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/FoodEstablishmentServesCuisineSKOS>,    <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/FoodEstablishmentHasPriceClassSKOS>,    <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/FoodEstablishmentHasAdditionalTourismOrRelatedFacilityServiceSKOS> .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/FoodEstablishmentMenuOptionsSKOS> a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "Alternativas o elecciones que están disponibles en un establecimiento de restauración en relación a los tipos de alimentos que se ofrecen. Estas opciones pueden adaptarse a las preferencias y necesidades dietéticas de los comensales, incluyendo alergias alimentarias, restricciones dietéticas, preferencias vegetarianas o veganas, entre otros."@es,    "Options or choices available in a food establishment regarding the types of food offered. These options may be adapted to diners’ preferences and dietary needs, including food allergies, dietary restrictions, vegetarian or vegan preferences, among others."@en;  sh:path estur:menuOptions;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/FoodEstablishmentMenuOptionsSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "menuOptions: The instance of FoodEstablishment has a menuOptions value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/FoodEstablishmentMenuOptionsSKOSInScheme>  a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/MenuOptions>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "menuOptions: The instance of FoodEstablishment has a menuOptions value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/MenuOptions."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/NaturalResourcePaymentMethodSKOS> a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "Method used by the customer to pay for the service."@en, "Método utilizado por el cliente para pagar el servicio."@es;  sh:path estur:paymentMethod;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/NaturalResourcePaymentMethodSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "paymentMethod: The instance of NaturalResource has a paymentMethod value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/NaturalResourcePaymentMethodSKOSInScheme>  a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/PaymentMethod>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "paymentMethod: The instance of NaturalResource has a paymentMethod value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/PaymentMethod."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/FoodEstablishmentServesCuisineSKOS> a    sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "Culinary tradition, preparation style, or regional cuisine of the world offered by a food establishment."@en,    "Tradición culinaria, estilo de preparación o cocina regional del mundo que ofrece un establecimiento de restauración."@es;  sh:path estur:servesCuisine;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/FoodEstablishmentServesCuisineSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "servesCuisine: The instance of FoodEstablishment has a servesCuisine value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/FoodEstablishmentServesCuisineSKOSInScheme>  a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/CuisineType>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "servesCuisine: The instance of FoodEstablishment has a servesCuisine value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/CuisineType."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/SpecialOfferShape> a sh:NodeShape;  rdfs:label "Propuesta especial"@es, "Special offer"@en;  sh:description "Offer of products that vary from the regular offer of tourism service providers, including, but not limited to, plans, temporary price reductions, and free gifts or extra quantities."@en,    "Propuesta de productos que difieren de la oferta habitual de los proveedores de servicios turísticos, incluyendo, entre otros, planes, reducciones temporales de precios y obsequios o cantidades adicionales."@es;  sh:name "Propuesta especial"@es, "Special offer"@en;  sh:nodeKind sh:IRI;  sh:targetClass estur:SpecialOffer;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/SpecialOfferTargetAudienceSKOS>,    <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/SpecialOfferHasTagSKOS> .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/SpecialOfferTargetAudienceSKOS> a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "A specific group of people targeted by a price or special offer, based on their age."@en,    "Grupo específico de personas al que va dirigido un precio o una propuesta especial, según la edad."@es;  sh:path estur:targetAudience;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/SpecialOfferTargetAudienceSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "targetAudience: The instance of SpecialOffer has a targetAudience value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/SpecialOfferTargetAudienceSKOSInScheme>  a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/TargetAudience>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "targetAudience: The instance of SpecialOffer has a targetAudience value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/TargetAudience."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/DestinationExperienceShape> a sh:NodeShape;  rdfs:label "Destination experience"@en, "Experiencia en destino"@es;  sh:description "Price-free experiences that the destination proposes so that the tourist integrates into the way of life of its inhabitants, their culture and their authenticity, to motivate the completion of the trip or so that they take away a memory that survives after it and can be transmitted to others. It allows establishing an emotional relationship between the tourist and the inhabitants of the destination."@en,    "Vivencias libres de precio que el destino propone para que el turista se integre en la forma de vivir de sus habitantes, su cultura y su autenticidad, para motivar la realización del viaje o bien para que se lleve un recuerdo que perviva después del mismo y pueda ser transmitido a los demás. Permite establecer una relación emocional entre el turista y los habitantes del destino."@es;  sh:name "Destination experience"@en, "Experiencia en destino"@es;  sh:nodeKind sh:IRI;  sh:targetClass estur:DestinationExperience;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/DestinationExperienceTimeOfTheYearSKOS> .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/DestinationExperienceTimeOfTheYearSKOS>  a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "A seasonal period during which a destination experience, agrotourism experience, or route is recommended, or during which it has greater relevance, intensity, or appeal."@en,    "Periodo estacional en el que se recomienda realizar la experiencia en destino, experiencia agroturística o ruta, o en el que esta tiene mayor relevancia, intensidad o atractivo."@es;  sh:path estur:timeOfTheYear;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/DestinationExperienceTimeOfTheYearSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "timeOfTheYear: The instance of DestinationExperience has a timeOfTheYear value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/DestinationExperienceTimeOfTheYearSKOSInScheme>  a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/TimeOfTheYear>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "timeOfTheYear: The instance of DestinationExperience has a timeOfTheYear value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/TimeOfTheYear."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/TourGuideShape> a sh:NodeShape;  rdfs:label "Guía turístico"@es, "Tour guide"@en;  sh:description "Person with extensive knowledge of the destination, capable of expressing himself in two or more languages, whose responsibility is to serve, inform and assist tourists on the tours they take."@en,    "Persona con amplio conocimiento del destino, capaz de expresarse en dos o más idiomas, cuya responsabilidad es atender, informar y asistir a los turistas en los tours que realizan."@es;  sh:name "Guía turístico"@es, "Tour guide"@en;  sh:nodeKind sh:IRI;  sh:targetClass estur:TourGuide;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/TourGuideTourSpecialtySKOS> .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/TourGuideTourSpecialtySKOS> a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "Enfoque particular o características únicas que distinguen al servicio de visita guiada."@es,    "Particular focus or unique features that distinguish the tour service."@en;  sh:path estur:tourSpecialty;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/TourGuideTourSpecialtySKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "tourSpecialty: The instance of TourGuide has a tourSpecialty value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/TourGuideTourSpecialtySKOSInScheme> a    sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/TourSpecialty>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "tourSpecialty: The instance of TourGuide has a tourSpecialty value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/TourSpecialty."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/HistoricalOrCulturalResourceTouristTypeSKOS>  a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "Clasificación para eventos, propuestas especiales, destinos y organizaciones turísticas, instalaciones turísticas o vinculadas, recursos y servicios turísticos en función de sus turistas objetivo con relación a sus motivaciones principales de viaje."@es,    """Classification for events, special offers, destinations andtourism organisations, tourism or related facilities, tourism resources and services based on their target tourists in relation to their main travel motivations."""@en;  sh:path estur:touristType;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/HistoricalOrCulturalResourceTouristTypeSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "touristType: The instance of HistoricalOrCulturalResource has a touristType value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/HistoricalOrCulturalResourceTouristTypeSKOSInScheme>  a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/TouristType>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "touristType: The instance of HistoricalOrCulturalResource has a touristType value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/TouristType."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/HistoricalOrCulturalResourceTravelUnitSKOS>  a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "Clasificación de eventos, propuestas especiales, destinos y organizaciones turísticas, instalaciones turísticas o relacionadas, recursos y servicios turísticos en función de sus turistas objetivo con relación a la composición del grupo con el que viajan y comparten los gastos asociados."@es,    "Classification for events, special offers, tourism destinations and organisations, tourism or related facilities, tourism resources and services based on their target tourists in relation to the composition of the party with whom they travel and share the associated expenses."@en;  sh:path estur:travelUnit;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/HistoricalOrCulturalResourceTravelUnitSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "travelUnit: The instance of HistoricalOrCulturalResource has a travelUnit value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/HistoricalOrCulturalResourceTravelUnitSKOSInScheme>  a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/TravelUnit>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "travelUnit: The instance of HistoricalOrCulturalResource has a travelUnit value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/TravelUnit."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/RouteHasAdditionalPetTourismResourceServiceSKOS>  a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "Complementary or additional services that a tourism resource may offer alongside its main service or activity in order to enhance or improve the experience of a tourist with pets."@en,    "Servicios complementarios o adicionales que puede ofrecer un recurso turístico junto a su servicio o actividad principal para ampliar o mejorar la experiencia del turista con mascotas."@es;  sh:path estur:hasAdditionalPetTourismResourceService;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/RouteHasAdditionalPetTourismResourceServiceSKOSInSch