ucationalFacilityHasAdditionalTourismOrRelatedFacilityServiceSKOSInScheme>  a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/AdditionalTourismOrRelatedFacilityService>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "hasAdditionalTourismOrRelatedFacilityService: The instance of EducationalFacility has a hasAdditionalTourismOrRelatedFacilityService value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/AdditionalTourismOrRelatedFacilityService."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/RouteHasAdditionalTourismResourceServiceSKOS>  a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "Complementary or additional services that a tourism resource may offer alongside its main service or activity in order to enhance or improve the user experience."@en,    "Servicios complementarios o adicionales que puede ofrecer un recurso turístico junto a su servicio o actividad principal para ampliar o mejorar la experiencia del usuario."@es;  sh:path estur:hasAdditionalTourismResourceService;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/RouteHasAdditionalTourismResourceServiceSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "hasAdditionalTourismResourceService: The instance of Route has a hasAdditionalTourismResourceService value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/RouteHasAdditionalTourismResourceServiceSKOSInScheme>  a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/AdditionalTourismResourceService>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "hasAdditionalTourismResourceService: The instance of Route has a hasAdditionalTourismResourceService value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/AdditionalTourismResourceService."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/VineyardShape> a sh:NodeShape;  rdfs:label "Vineyard"@en, "Viñedo"@es;  sh:description "Land intended for vine cultivation for grape production."@en, "Terreno destinado al cultivo de la vid para la producción de uva."@es;  sh:name "Vineyard"@en, "Viñedo"@es;  sh:nodeKind sh:IRI;  sh:targetClass estur:Vineyard;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/VineyardHasAdditionalWineTourismFacilityServiceSKOS> .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/VineyardHasAdditionalWineTourismFacilityServiceSKOS>  a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "Complementary or additional services that a wine tourism facility may offer alongside its main service or activity in order to enhance or improve the user experience."@en,    "Servicios complementarios o adicionales que puede ofrecer una instalación de enoturismo junto a su servicio o actividad principal para ampliar o mejorar la experiencia del usuario."@es;  sh:path estur:hasAdditionalWineTourismFacilityService;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/VineyardHasAdditionalWineTourismFacilityServiceSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "hasAdditionalWineTourismFacilityService: The instance of Vineyard has a hasAdditionalWineTourismFacilityService value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/VineyardHasAdditionalWineTourismFacilityServiceSKOSInScheme>  a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/AdditionalWineTourismFacilityService>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "hasAdditionalWineTourismFacilityService: The instance of Vineyard has a hasAdditionalWineTourismFacilityService value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/AdditionalWineTourismFacilityService."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/AgrotourismExperienceHasPriceClassSKOS>  a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "A range of prices at which products or services are offered, allowing them to be classified into different segments within a given market or industry."@en,    "Rango de precios en el que se ofrecen productos o servicios que permiten clasificarlos en diferentes segmentos dentro de un determinado mercado o industria."@es;  sh:path estur:hasPriceClass;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/AgrotourismExperienceHasPriceClassSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "hasPriceClass: The instance of AgrotourismExperience has a hasPriceClass value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/AgrotourismExperienceHasPriceClassSKOSInScheme>  a sh:PropertyShape;  sh:path skos:inScheme;  sh:hasValue <https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/PriceClass>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "hasPriceClass: The instance of AgrotourismExperience has a hasPriceClass value that is not one of the predefined values and cannot be converted into a SKOS concept on this list: https://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/kos/PriceClass."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/NaturalResourceHasTagSKOS> a sh:PropertyShape;  rdfs:comment "Conjunto de etiquetas utilizadas para clasificar y describir de forma sintética características, temáticas, atributos o enfoques experienciales asociados a un elemento."@es,    "Set of tags used to classify and describe, in a transversal manner, characteristics, themes, attributes or experiential approaches associated with an item."@en;  sh:path estur:hasTag;  sh:class skos:Concept;  sh:property <http://ontologia.segittur.es/turismo/shapes/NaturalResourceHasTagSKOSInScheme>;  sh:severity sh:violation;  sh:message "hasTag: The instance of NaturalResource has a hasTag value that is not a SKOS concept."@en .<http://ontologia.segittur.e